xtÙ)And there shall be no herd in the stalls:¦layout§quote_1ªlast_verse„¥verse¯paragraph_startÃ¥lines’‚¤text¿Yet I will rejoice in the LORD,¦layout ‚¤textÙ&I will joy in the God of my salvation.¦layout§quote_1ªlast_verse„¥verse¯paragraph_startÃ¥lines”‚¤text¼The LORD God is my strength,¦layout ‚¤textÙ*And he will make my feet like hinds' feet,¦layout§quote_1‚¤textÙ2And he will make me to walk upon mine high places.¦layout§quote_1‚¤textÙ/To the chief singer on my stringed instruments.¦layout©paragraphªlast_verse